{"seq":1,"slug":"feed-ack-ingestion-status-model","title":"渠道回执摄取与条目状态机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-content-syndication-multichannel-feed-ops/ack-reconciliation-ops/feed-ack-ingestion-status-model","wordCount":2305,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"渠道回执摄取与条目状态机\">渠道回执摄取与条目状态机</h1><p>凌晨两点把 4 万条商品的 feed 推给 Amazon，SP-API 响应 <code>202 Accepted</code>，HTTP 状态码漂亮得无可挑剔。运营第二天早上打开 Seller Central，发现 600 个 ASIN 不可购买。这十几个小时里系统「以为」一切正常——因为它把「提交被接受」当成了「商品上架」。Amazon 的 <code>feedId</code> 只是入队凭据，真正的结论藏在 <code>processingStatus</code> 从 <code>IN_QUEUE</code> 走到 <code>DONE</code> 之后、由 <code>resultFeedDocumentId</code> 指向的那份 gzip 处理报告里（<a href=\"https://developer-docs.amazon.com/sp-api/docs/feeds-api-v2021-06-30-reference\">https://developer-docs.amazon.com/sp-api/docs/feeds-api-v2021-06-30-reference</a> ）。回执工程要解决的核心问题是：把「一次性事件」变成「可追踪、可对账、可回退检测的条目状态机」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三层回执的粒度拆分\">核心概念：三层回执的粒度拆分</h2><p>所有渠道反馈按粒度拆成三层，是设计回执管道的第一步，混为一谈是大多数对账 bug 的根源。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[feed 提交] --&gt; B{L1 传输回执}&#10;  B --&gt;|4xx/5xx| B1[重试或死信&lt;br/&gt;无状态影响]&#10;  B --&gt;|accepted| C{L2 批次回执}&#10;  C --&gt;|IN_QUEUE / IN_PROGRESS| C1[轮询或推送等待]&#10;  C --&gt;|DONE + resultFeedDocumentId| D[下载处理报告]&#10;  C --&gt;|FATAL| C2[整批状态未知]&#10;  D --&gt; E{L3 条目回执}&#10;  E --&gt;|每条 item 的 code/severity| F[条目状态机转移]&#10;  F --&gt; G[对账 + 告警 + 处置]\">graph TD\n  A[feed 提交] --&gt; B{L1 传输回执}\n  B --&gt;|4xx/5xx| B1[重试或死信&lt;br/&gt;无状态影响]\n  B --&gt;|accepted| C{L2 批次回执}\n  C --&gt;|IN_QUEUE / IN_PROGRESS| C1[轮询或推送等待]\n  C --&gt;|DONE + resultFeedDocumentId| D[下载处理报告]\n  C --&gt;|FATAL| C2[整批状态未知]\n  D --&gt; E{L3 条目回执}\n  E --&gt;|每条 item 的 code/severity| F[条目状态机转移]\n  F --&gt; G[对账 + 告警 + 处置]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>载体</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>时效</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L1 传输</td>\n<td>HTTP 状态 / 同步响应体</td>\n<td>请求被接收，<strong>不代表内容合法</strong></td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2 批次</td>\n<td>feed 资源轮询</td>\n<td>整批处理完成与否</td>\n<td>分钟~小时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3 条目</td>\n<td>处理报告 / 状态资源</td>\n<td>单条商品的最终裁决</td>\n<td>小时~天</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>L1 的陷阱在 Amazon Listings Items API 上最清楚：<code>ListingsItemSubmissionResponse.status</code> 只有三个值——<code>ACCEPTED</code>（接受处理）、<code>INVALID</code>（未通过校验）、<code>VALID</code>（仅当 <code>mode=VALIDATION_PREVIEW</code> 时返回的纯预检结果）（<a href=\"https://developer-docs.amazon.com/sp-api/docs/listings-items-api-v2021-08-01-use-case-guide\">https://developer-docs.amazon.com/sp-api/docs/listings-items-api-v2021-08-01-use-case-guide</a> ）。<code>ACCEPTED</code> 是「排上队了」不是「上架了」；商品能否真卖要读 <code>ItemSummaryByMarketplace.status</code> 的 <code>BUYABLE</code> / <code>DISCOVERABLE</code>，而这两个状态<strong>不在</strong>提交响应里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"条目状态机的建模-维度优先于状态名\">条目状态机的建模：维度优先于状态名</h2><p>条目状态不是单一标量，而是带维度的向量。同一 SKU 在 Amazon 上可能 <code>BUYABLE</code> 但在某国不可发现；在 Google 上可能整体 <code>DISAPPROVED</code> 却仍在某个 reporting context 正常投放。忽略维度会导致状态互相覆盖。</p>\n<p>状态机的 key 至少是四元组 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>o</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(item, channel, context, geo)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">hann</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">eo</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。Google Merchant API 的 <code>ProductStatus</code> 把维度显式拆开：<code>destinationStatuses[]</code> 每条按 <code>reportingContext</code> 分组，再分列 <code>approvedCountries[]</code>、<code>pendingCountries[]</code>、<code>disapprovedCountries[]</code> 三个国家码数组（<a href=\"https://developers.google.com/merchant/api/reference/rest/products_v1/accounts.products\">https://developers.google.com/merchant/api/reference/rest/products_v1/accounts.products</a> ）。所以一条商品的状态在存储上应是若干条 <code>(item, context, country) -&gt; status</code> 记录。</p>\n<p>两处必须显式处理。第一是<strong>幂等</strong>：回执按 at-least-once 投递是常态，同一回执可能被拉取两次、或推送与轮询同时命中，状态转移必须是「以事件时间为准的 upsert」而非「无条件覆盖」，否则一次乱序重放就把已前进的状态打回旧值。第二是<strong>回退检测</strong>：已 <code>approved</code> 的商品突然出现 <code>disapprovedCountries</code>，是平台侧执法或落地页不一致的信号。维护每个 key 的事件时间水位 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_e &lt; W_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 判定陈旧、丢弃并计数；只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_e \\ge W_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.786em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 才允许推进状态并把水位抬到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"严重度与执法动作-把渠道语义映射到统一模型\">严重度与执法动作：把渠道语义映射到统一模型</h2><p>不同渠道的「问题严重性」词表不一致，必须在规范化层收敛成可比较的等级。Google 新 Merchant API 用 <code>ItemLevelIssue.severity</code>，枚举为 <code>SEVERITY_UNSPECIFIED</code>、<code>NOT_IMPACTED</code>（仅警告）、<code>DEMOTED</code>（降权）、<code>DISAPPROVED</code>（拒登）（<a href=\"https://developers.google.com/merchant/api/reference/rest/products_v1/accounts.products\">https://developers.google.com/merchant/api/reference/rest/products_v1/accounts.products</a> ）。坑在于旧版 Content API v2.1 的 <code>productstatuses.itemLevelIssues[]</code> <strong>没有</strong> <code>severity</code>，它用 <code>servability</code> 表达同一语义（<a href=\"https://developers.google.com/shopping-content/reference/rest/v2.1/productstatuses\">https://developers.google.com/shopping-content/reference/rest/v2.1/productstatuses</a> ）；迁移期两套词表并存，规范化层需同时接受。Content API for Shopping 已于 <strong>2026 年 8 月 18 日</strong>日落、<strong>2026 年 9 月 1 日</strong>起逐步报错（<a href=\"https://developers.google.com/merchant/api/guides/products/overview\">https://developers.google.com/merchant/api/guides/products/overview</a> ）。</p>\n<p>Amazon 的 <code>Issue.severity</code> 是 <code>ERROR</code>/<code>WARNING</code>/<code>INFO</code> 三值，但运营语义在 <code>IssueEnforcementAction.action</code> 上——<code>LISTING_SUPPRESSED</code>（下架、失去 buyability）、<code>ATTRIBUTE_SUPPRESSED</code>（某属性被拒）、<code>CATALOG_ITEM_REMOVED</code>（目录项失活，所有 offer 均不可购）、<code>SEARCH_SUPPRESSED</code>（从搜索隐藏）（<a href=\"https://developer-docs.amazon.com/sp-api/docs/listings-items-api-v2021-08-01-reference\">https://developer-docs.amazon.com/sp-api/docs/listings-items-api-v2021-08-01-reference</a> ）。四者商业损失量级完全不同，却都挂在同一个 <code>ERROR</code> 之下。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>统一等级</th>\n<th>Google 语义</th>\n<th>Amazon 语义</th>\n<th>运营动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>INFO</td>\n<td><code>NOT_IMPACTED</code></td>\n<td><code>severity=INFO</code></td>\n<td>仅记录，不计入 SLO</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WARN</td>\n<td><code>DEMOTED</code></td>\n<td><code>severity=WARNING</code></td>\n<td>计数、纳入待处理队列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BLOCK</td>\n<td><code>DISAPPROVED</code></td>\n<td><code>LISTING_SUPPRESSED</code>、<code>ATTRIBUTE_SUPPRESSED</code></td>\n<td>立即告警、进入处置流程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GONE</td>\n<td>—（无独立枚举）</td>\n<td><code>CATALOG_ITEM_REMOVED</code></td>\n<td>最高优先级，校验主数据是否被删除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HIDDEN</td>\n<td>—（<code>reportingContext</code> 收敛表达）</td>\n<td><code>SEARCH_SUPPRESSED</code></td>\n<td>告警但允许延迟处置</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>映射表必须是<strong>数据表</strong>而不是代码分支：渠道每季度改一次词表（上面的 <code>servability</code>→<code>severity</code> 就是一次），逻辑写死在 <code>if channel == ...</code> 里意味着每次改动都要发版回归。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对账算法-本地集合与渠道集合的差异分类\">对账算法：本地集合与渠道集合的差异分类</h2><p>状态机的最终用途是对账——判断「本地认为该上架的商品」与「渠道实际在售的商品」是否一致。设本地期望集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>local</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{\\text{local}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">local</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、渠道报告的可售集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>channel</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{\\text{channel}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">channel</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，对账覆盖率</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>local</mtext></msub><mo>∩</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>channel</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>local</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = \\frac{|S_{\\text{local}} \\cap S_{\\text{channel}}|}{|S_{\\text{local}}|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">local</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">local</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">channel</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时差异必须分类，不同类别对应完全不同的修复动作。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>差异类型</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>根因</th>\n<th>处置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>丢失</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>local</mtext></msub><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>channel</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\in S_{\\text{local}} \\setminus S_{\\text{channel}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">local</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∖</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">channel</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>回执未摄入、静默拒登、feed 未覆盖</td>\n<td>重放回执 / 补推 / 查规则缺口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>幽灵</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>channel</mtext></msub><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>local</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\in S_{\\text{channel}} \\setminus S_{\\text{local}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">channel</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∖</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">local</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>已下架但渠道未同步、重复提交</td>\n<td>补发 delete / 去重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态漂移</td>\n<td>两边都在但状态不同</td>\n<td>审批异步、执法事件未消费</td>\n<td>重拉状态资源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>维度分裂</td>\n<td>同 item 不同 context/country 结论矛盾</td>\n<td>映射未按地域投影</td>\n<td>查 transform 层的地域分支</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「丢失」里最隐蔽的是<strong>静默拒登</strong>：feed 批次 <code>processingStatus=DONE</code>，处理报告里也<strong>没有</strong>该 item 的报错条目——因为渠道没把它算进本次提交。Amazon 的 <code>Feed.processingStatus</code> 枚举里 <code>FATAL</code> 语义尤其危险，文档原文是「feed 因致命错误中止，其内的部分、全部或零个操作可能已成功完成」（<a href=\"https://developer-docs.amazon.com/sp-api/docs/feeds-api-v2021-06-30-reference\">https://developer-docs.amazon.com/sp-api/docs/feeds-api-v2021-06-30-reference</a> ）——这是「不知道发生了什么」的状态，唯一安全处理是全量重拉该 batch 覆盖的 item 状态再对账，而非假设整批失败后原样重放。这要求 feed 与 item 的关联关系在提交时就落库。</p>\n<h2 id=\"摄取管道-拉取与推送的统一\">摄取管道：拉取与推送的统一</h2><p>回执的到达方式有两类，管道必须同时支持。<strong>拉取</strong>：拿 <code>resultFeedDocumentId</code> 换一个 5 分钟过期的预签名 URL 下载报告，<code>compressionAlgorithm=GZIP</code> 时先解压（<a href=\"https://developer-docs.amazon.com/sp-api/docs/feeds-api-v2021-06-30-reference\">https://developer-docs.amazon.com/sp-api/docs/feeds-api-v2021-06-30-reference</a> ）。5 分钟窗口是硬约束——大报告要流式下载而非先存内存，下载失败要能重新换 URL，绝不能把 URL 本身当长期凭据。</p>\n<p><strong>推送</strong>是 2026 年的主流补充。Google Merchant API 的 <code>NotificationSubscription</code> 支持注册 <code>registeredEvent</code>（<code>NotificationEventType</code> 枚举）并配 <code>callBackUri</code> 接收推送，事件类型含 <code>ProductStatusChangeMessage</code> 与 <code>ResourceChangeMessage</code>；推送载荷需按 Merchant API 解码流程处理，订阅可设 <code>allManagedAccounts=true</code> 覆盖托管账户（<a href=\"https://developers.google.com/merchant/api/reference/rest/notifications_v1/accounts.notificationsubscriptions\">https://developers.google.com/merchant/api/reference/rest/notifications_v1/accounts.notificationsubscriptions</a> ）。推送把状态收敛延迟从轮询周期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 的期望 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta T/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span> 降到一次网络往返加队列处理。</p>\n<p>但推送<strong>不能替代</strong>全量对账：推送是丢得起的（端点宕机、回调被限流、事件在重试窗口外被丢弃），违背「不知道就别假设」的代价是永久性漂移。正确架构是推送负责低延迟、周期性全量对账负责正确性，两者用上一节的差异分类闭环。这条链路的缺陷类别（如「报告下载成功但解析枚举失败」）与 <a href=\"../feed-build-transform/feed-transform-failure-modes\">feed 转换失败模式</a> 同源，可共用同一套死信与重放机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"运营闭环-从回执到处置\">运营闭环：从回执到处置</h2><p>回执管道的终点不是「状态正确」，而是「问题被处置」。盯盘顺序是「聚合 → 分组 → 明细」：先看 <code>aggregateProductStatuses</code> 的计数，再按 <code>code</code> 分组（命中 3000 条是映射问题、命中 3 条是数据问题）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>告警阈值直觉</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ack 延迟</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>ack</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>submit</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{ack}} - t_{\\text{submit}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ack</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">submit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的 P95</td>\n<td>超过渠道 SLA 一半即查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通过率</td>\n<td><code>approved</code> 条目数 / 提交条目数</td>\n<td>相对上周降幅 &gt; 5% 即查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抑制净额</td>\n<td>新增 BLOCK/GONE 数 − 已恢复数</td>\n<td>持续为正说明数据源在腐化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回退率</td>\n<td>状态回退事件数 / 总转移数</td>\n<td>非零且上升说明存在乱序或映射错误</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>处置能力本身也要建模。Google 的 <code>IssueResolutionService</code>（<code>RenderProductIssues</code>、<code>RenderAccountIssues</code>、<code>TriggerAction</code>）返回的 <code>RenderedIssue</code> 携带 <code>Action</code>/<code>BuiltInSimpleAction</code> 等可执行项，聚合视图 <code>AggregateProductStatus</code> 则按 <code>reportingContext</code> + <code>country</code> 给出 <code>activeCount</code>、<code>pendingCount</code>、<code>disapprovedCount</code>、<code>expiringCount</code>（<a href=\"https://developers.google.com/merchant/api/reference/rest/issueresolution_v1/accounts.aggregateProductStatuses\">https://developers.google.com/merchant/api/reference/rest/issueresolution_v1/accounts.aggregateProductStatuses</a> ）。两者结合可做<strong>程序化修复</strong>：若 issue 明确携带 <code>attributeName</code>（如 <code>availability</code>、<code>price</code>），且 <a href=\"../compliance-validation-quality/validation-rule-engine-preflight\">校验规则引擎与出站 Preflight 质量门</a> 里已有对应修复规则，就自动生成补丁 feed 重推。反过来 Amazon 的 <code>IssueExemption.status</code>（<code>EXEMPT</code>/<code>EXEMPT_UNTIL_EXPIRY_DATE</code>/<code>NOT_EXEMPT</code>）表明平台侧存在「豁免」——被豁免的执法动作不应进入运营队列（<a href=\"https://developer-docs.amazon.com/sp-api/docs/listings-items-api-v2021-08-01-reference\">https://developer-docs.amazon.com/sp-api/docs/listings-items-api-v2021-08-01-reference</a> ）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>把回执工程做对，落在几条上：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>分层</strong>——L1 的 <code>ACCEPTED</code> 不代表 L3 条目裁决，Amazon 的 <code>VALID</code> 只在 <code>VALIDATION_PREVIEW</code> 模式返回，绝不可当作上线成功。</li>\n<li><strong>维度化</strong>——状态 key 是 <code>(item, channel, context, geo)</code>，Google 的 <code>destinationStatuses[]</code> 已把三类国家码拆开存储，本地必须照此建模。</li>\n<li><strong>幂等 + 水位</strong>——回执至少一次投递，用事件时间水位 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 丢弃陈旧回执，回退事件单独告警。</li>\n<li><strong>严重度映射是数据表不是代码</strong>——Google 的 <code>severity</code> 与 Amazon 的 <code>enforcement.action</code> 含义不同，需收敛成统一等级。</li>\n<li><strong>拉取与推送并用</strong>——5 分钟预签名 URL 要流式下载，推送降延迟但必须留全量对账兜底。</li>\n<li><strong>对账差异要分类</strong>——丢失、幽灵、漂移、维度分裂四类根因与处置各异。</li>\n<li><strong><code>FATAL</code> 是未知状态</strong>——文档明说操作可能部分完成，只能全量重拉而非假设失败重放。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"渠道回执摄取与条目状态机","id":"渠道回执摄取与条目状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三层回执的粒度拆分","id":"核心概念-三层回执的粒度拆分"},{"level":2,"text":"条目状态机的建模：维度优先于状态名","id":"条目状态机的建模-维度优先于状态名"},{"level":2,"text":"严重度与执法动作：把渠道语义映射到统一模型","id":"严重度与执法动作-把渠道语义映射到统一模型"},{"level":2,"text":"对账算法：本地集合与渠道集合的差异分类","id":"对账算法-本地集合与渠道集合的差异分类"},{"level":2,"text":"摄取管道：拉取与推送的统一","id":"摄取管道-拉取与推送的统一"},{"level":2,"text":"运营闭环：从回执到处置","id":"运营闭环-从回执到处置"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"商品质量评分、渠道降权与修复闭环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-content-syndication-multichannel-feed-ops/compliance-validation-quality/quality-scoring-suppression-remediation"},"next":{"title":"对账差异检测与线上漂移收敛","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-content-syndication-multichannel-feed-ops/ack-reconciliation-ops/reconciliation-diff-drift"}}